## 3. QA Gate & Execution Safety
- **Schema Validation:** `powershell -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File .cline/scripts/c-query-org.ps1 -Describe <SObject>`
- **Post-Creation QA Gate:** `powershell -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File .cline/scripts/c-run-qa-gate.ps1 -TestClasses "<TestClass>"`
- **Deployment Safety:** Deployments to `SUNY_COMMON_DEV` are `--dry-run` only until explicit confirmation in the current turn.
